# fascia - colour survey. every five colour cool palette at the hero seed, four sheets.
# run: just sweep fascia_colors     (pngs + one contact sheet per branch in output/fascia_colors)
# cool takes any cool palette straight, past the FIVES pick - pal is ignored while cool > 0.
# 129 fives on 2026-09-28, the list Palettes.coolPalettesOfSize(5) gives. the 28 in FIVES are in
# here too, so the sheets show the whole field.

art    = fascia.FasciaKt
module = arts:flowforce
out    = output/fascia_colors
par    = 6
#
# Settled 2026-09-28: the cool knob is gone, the picks went into FIVES (pal 29-34). the branches
# stay below as the record. run as is, it renders the hero once.

